ECT QUERIES FOR HIGH PERFORMING DASHBOARDS AND ANALYTICS. GONE IS THE REQUIREMENT TO COPY DATA INTO DATA WAREHOUSES FIRST – A COSTLY, COMPLEX, RISKY AND INFLEXIBLE PROC'}{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2021-03-18 11:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Keysight's 5G Device Test Solution Recognized for Innovative Breakthrough in Mobile Technology by GTI", 'text': "SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #5G--KEYSIGHT'S 5G DEVICE TEST SOLUTION RECOGNIZED FOR INNOVATIVE BREAKTHROUGH IN MOBILE TECHNOLOGY BY GTI"}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-03-18 13:07:00-04:56', 'title': 'LDOS INVESTOR FILING DEADLINE: Bernstein Liebhard LLP Reminds Investors of the Deadline to File a Lead Plaintiff Motion In a Securities Class Action Lawsuit Against Leidos Holdings, Inc.', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MARCH 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BERNSTEIN LIEBHARD, A NATIONALLY ACCLAIMED INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT THAT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR ACQUIRED THE SECURITIES OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. ("LEIDOS HOLDINGS" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: LDOS) FROM MAY 4, 2020 THROUGH FEBRUARY 23, 2021 (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). THE LAWSUIT FILED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK ALLEGES VIOLATIONS OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934.'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-03-18 10:19:00-04:56', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: Levi & Korsinsky, LLP Notifies Shareholders of Leidos Holdings, Inc. of a Class Action Lawsuit and a Lead Plaintiff Deadline of May 3, 2021 - LDOS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - MARCH 18, 2021) - THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT IS BEING ISSUED BY LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP:TO: ALL PERSONS OR ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED SECURITIES OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. ("LEIDOS HOLDINGS") (NYSE: LDOS) BETWEEN MAY 4, 2020 AND FEBRUARY 23, 2021. YOU ARE HEREBY NOTIFIED THAT A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE UNITED STATE